{"id":1160201,"chapter_id":1160201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，这名禁闭者非常危险。\n审查时我会守在外面，如果超过十五分钟，我会进来查看情况。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1160200},{"step":2,"options":["不用了，我自己会小心的","辛苦了，不过应该不会超过十五分钟"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201003,"trial_step":3,"course":3,"drawing":1160200,"choices":[{"text":"不用了，我自己会小心的","goto":4},{"text":"辛苦了，不过应该不会超过十五分钟","goto":4}]},{"step":3,"content":"夜莺欲言又止，这更加激发了你的好奇——","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1160200},{"step":4,"content":"你即将面对的究竟是个怎样的危险人物，可以让你的副官如此担心？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1160200},{"step":5,"content":"“啪嗒。”","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":6,"content":"在进入审查室的同时，你听见了金属碰撞的清脆声响。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1160200},{"step":7,"content":"你今日审查的对象——卡米利安，正坐在椅子上把玩一枚镀金怀表。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1160200},{"step":8,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"这么防备我……夜莺小姐真是位称职的副官，对局长非常忠心呢~","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1160201},{"step":9,"content":"明明是句夸奖，听起来却颇有些阴阳怪气的意思。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1160201},{"step":10,"content":"既然知道时间有限，就别说废话了，我们进入正题吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1160200},{"step":11,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":12,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":13,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":14,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":15,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":16,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":17,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":18,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":12,"course":6,"drawing":1160200},{"step":19,"content":"你和<color=#e45515>杰克诺尔家族</color>的人都是什么关系？为什么擅自对他们进行催眠？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1160200},{"step":20,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长居然真的认为，催眠别人是一项罪行吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1160200},{"step":21,"content":"她扫了一眼白纸黑字上对自己的控诉，全然没有认罪的意思。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1160200},{"step":22,"content":"根据记录显示，被你催眠的四人，已经依次出现了不同程度的幻觉幻听症状。\n甚至因为精神失常，多次尝试自杀……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1160200},{"step":23,"content":"你出于自己的不明目的，对别人造成了实质性、难以修复的伤害，难道还不算是犯罪吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1160200},{"step":24,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"那您与禁闭者之间因枷锁而导致的精神连接，不也是一项罪行吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1160201},{"step":25,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"所谓的擅自催眠，和擅自连接别人的精神世界，又有什么不同呢？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1160201},{"step":26,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我们都一样，在未经对方许可的情况下，入侵别人的潜意识，激发他们的痛苦。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1160201},{"step":27,"options":["不，我和你不一样","我没有心思和你狡辩"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201021,"trial_step":21,"course":3,"drawing":1160200,"choices":[{"text":"不，我和你不一样","goto":22},{"text":"我没有心思和你狡辩","goto":26}]},{"step":28,"content":"精神连接只是枷锁的副作用，不是我的本意。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1160200},{"step":29,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哦？是吗……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1160201},{"step":30,"content":"“啪嗒。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1160201},{"step":31,"content":"她继续把玩着怀表，在清脆的金属碰撞声中，饶有兴味地打量你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1160201,"next":[29]},{"step":32,"content":"枷锁导致的副作用是被动的，而你却是主动催眠，你的目的究竟是……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1160200},{"step":33,"content":"“啪嗒。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1160200},{"step":34,"content":"怀表开合的声音打断了你的问话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1160200,"next":[29]},{"step":35,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"那……审查呢？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1160201},{"step":36,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"审查不就是局长在主动刺激禁闭者，强迫他们回忆那些不愿言说的过去吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1160201},{"step":37,"options":["是为了查清你们的罪行","你别再岔开话题了"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201031,"trial_step":31,"course":3,"drawing":1160200,"choices":[{"text":"是为了查清你们的罪行","goto":32},{"text":"你别再岔开话题了","goto":33}]},{"step":38,"content":"我有我的判断和取舍，不需要一名禁闭者来操心。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1160200,"next":[34]},{"step":39,"content":"无论是精神连接还是审查的合理性，都不该是我们今天讨论的主题。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1160200,"next":[34]},{"step":40,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"所以，局长阁下并没有否认，审查就是在逼迫禁闭者面对会令他们痛苦的真相？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1160201},{"step":41,"content":"这些是为了狄斯安全和律法公正，必须做的事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1160200},{"step":42,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"即便你知道这些真相会伤害到他们……\n即便你知道很多禁闭者其实不是恶人。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1160203},{"step":43,"content":"我至少没有让他们像杰克诺尔家族的人那样，在审查后出现精神问题。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1160203},{"step":44,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"呵呵~那你所看见的那些梦境又是什么？\n他们真的没有因为你的审问，而受到伤害吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1160203},{"step":45,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长肯定比我更加清楚，审查室是个充满压迫感的空间……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1160203},{"step":46,"content":"卡米利安扫视了一圈审查室内的重重监控设备，叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1160203},{"step":47,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"从这样的环境走出去后，他们真的还能将局长视为并肩作战的“朋友”吗。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1160203},{"step":48,"content":"卡米利安看着你的眼神，带着罕见哀愁，似乎真的在为你的处境感到担忧。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1160203},{"step":49,"options":["你为什么要跟我聊这些？","别再绕圈子了……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201043,"trial_step":43,"course":3,"drawing":1160203,"choices":[{"text":"你为什么要跟我聊这些？","goto":44},{"text":"别再绕圈子了……","goto":46}]},{"step":50,"content":"是你自己有什么痛苦，不想被我揭穿，还是说……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1160200},{"step":51,"content":"让我对审查和精神连接产生动摇和愧疚，对你有什么好处？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1160200,"next":[49]},{"step":52,"content":"聊了那么久，你没有透露任何关于罪行的信息。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1160200},{"step":53,"content":"相反，你一直在套我的话，似乎想要让我对梦境的连接和审查产生动摇。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1160200},{"step":54,"content":"你究竟有什么目的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1160200,"next":[49]},{"step":55,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1160201},{"step":56,"content":"上一秒还神色怨艾的女人，转眼就放下伪装笑出声来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1160201},{"step":57,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长，你很聪明，但……还不够聪明。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1160200},{"step":58,"content":"“啪嗒！”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1160200},{"step":59,"content":"她手中的怀表再一次开合，这次的声音却格外尖锐，让你感到一阵眩晕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1160200},{"step":60,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长！","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1160200},{"step":61,"content":"夜莺的声音让你很快清醒过来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1160200},{"step":62,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"时间到了，先暂停审查吧。","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1160200},{"step":63,"content":"居然已经十五分钟了？时间流逝的速度比你预想的快得多。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1160200},{"step":64,"options":["妥协离开","要求继续审查"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201059,"trial_step":59,"course":3,"drawing":1160200,"choices":[{"text":"妥协离开","goto":60},{"text":"要求继续审查","goto":62}]},{"step":65,"content":"那今天就到这里吧，下次不会再给你回避问题的机会。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1160200},{"step":66,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"嗯哼，请便~","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1160201,"next":[65]},{"step":67,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"不行，和具有催眠异能的禁闭者共处一室非常危险！","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1160200},{"step":68,"content":"夜莺的态度异常强硬。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1160200},{"step":69,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"还是别让夜莺小姐为难了，她也是为了您的安全考虑呢~","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1160201,"next":[65]},{"step":70,"content":"卡米利安的语气愉悦，是因为逃过了罪行阐述而感到开心吗？她的微笑总让你觉得有些不对劲。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1160201},{"step":71,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哎呀！哪个不长眼睛的！","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1160201},{"step":72,"speaker":"海拉","content":"是局长啊——你一路念叨着什么“接下来该怎么对付卡米利安呢”，也不看路，不会是审傻了吧？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201067,"trial_step":67},{"step":73,"speaker":"海拉","content":"说吧，这次又问出了什么刺激的小故事？她有没有哭着求你——“呜呜呜你别再说了我都告诉你~”","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201068,"trial_step":68},{"step":74,"speaker":"艾瑞尔","content":"局长每天要处理那么多烦心事，不小心撞到人也是有的，你就别怪局长啦。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201069,"trial_step":69},{"step":75,"speaker":"艾瑞尔","content":"而且，局长也不是你口中那种没有边界感的人……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201070,"trial_step":70},{"step":76,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哦——是嘛？我还以为局长把大家当成乐子，一对一找我们听故事消遣呢！","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201071,"trial_step":71},{"step":77,"content":"我从没有将这当做消遣，我只是为了更加了解你们。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201072,"trial_step":72},{"step":78,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哈哈哈哈哈——了解？明明就是假惺惺地说些好听话，哄我们把自己不想说的过去告诉你！","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201073,"trial_step":73},{"step":79,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我认为这没有什么不妥。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201074,"trial_step":74},{"step":80,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"从各个方面了解禁闭者，才能更好地在战场上应用禁闭者的异能。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201075,"trial_step":75},{"step":81,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"只要是局长的命令，我都会配合。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201076,"trial_step":76},{"step":82,"speaker":"海拉","content":"其他人呢？大家都愿意和赫卡蒂一样配合你的*文明*问答游戏吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201077,"trial_step":77},{"step":83,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"据管理局记录，审查前并不存在征询禁闭者个人意愿的环节……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201078,"trial_step":78},{"step":84,"options":["我从没有强迫过你们"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201079,"trial_step":79,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我从没有强迫过你们","goto":80}]},{"step":85,"content":"在别人眼里禁闭者或许是危险和禁忌，但我希望和你们成为朋友、解开你们的心结。每一场审查我都认真应对，这对我而言不是“看热闹”和“听故事。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201080,"trial_step":80},{"step":86,"speaker":"艾瑞尔","content":"不是么……？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201081,"trial_step":81},{"step":87,"content":"艾瑞尔的声音有些颤抖，她明显在逃避你的眼神，有些畏惧地后退两步。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201082,"trial_step":82},{"step":88,"content":"这让你回忆起卡米利安的话——","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201083,"trial_step":83},{"step":89,"content":"她们真的没有因为你的审问，而受到伤害吗？","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201084,"trial_step":84},{"step":90,"options":["为自己辩解","怀疑她们"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201085,"trial_step":85,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"为自己辩解","goto":86},{"text":"怀疑她们","goto":88}]},{"step":91,"content":"我在审查中都会优先照顾大家的感受，一旦情况有异都会立刻中止流程。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201086,"trial_step":86},{"step":92,"speaker":"温蒂","content":"哈哈哈哈哈，你对谁都这么说吧？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201087,"trial_step":87,"next":[90]},{"step":93,"content":"你们为什么突然跟我聊这个？是有人向你们泄露了刚刚审查的内容吗？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201088,"trial_step":88},{"step":94,"speaker":"温蒂","content":"哈哈哈哈哈，你自己做的事，还不想承认吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201089,"trial_step":89,"next":[90]},{"step":95,"content":"刚才还在眼前和你说话的三人，倏忽间变成挥动着电锯的温蒂，发出尖锐的笑声。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201090,"trial_step":90},{"step":96,"speaker":"温蒂","content":"哈哈哈你是不是觉得，禁闭者都应该感谢你？\n死在我回忆里的每一个人，都应该感谢你？哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201091,"trial_step":91},{"step":97,"content":"你什么时候出现在这里的……","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201092,"trial_step":92},{"step":98,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"你什么都做不了，悲剧已经发生了……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201093,"trial_step":93},{"step":99,"content":"眼前的人总是在顷刻间发生变化，这一定不正常！你开始感到头痛眩晕。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201094,"trial_step":94},{"step":100,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你只是好奇我们的隐私而已，别说得冠冕堂皇的。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201095,"trial_step":95},{"step":101,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"你想窥探我们的痛苦。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201096,"trial_step":96},{"step":102,"content":"不是这样的。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201097,"trial_step":97},{"step":103,"speaker":"九十九","content":"看到我们被你的枷锁折磨，你很得意？","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201098,"trial_step":98},{"step":104,"content":"我从来没有这样想过。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201099,"trial_step":99},{"step":105,"content":"你努力想让自己冷静下来，但脑子里却一片混乱。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201100,"trial_step":100},{"step":106,"speaker":"安","content":"其实，配合审查只是无奈之举啊……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201101,"trial_step":101},{"step":107,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"讨人厌的家伙，少在那假惺惺的了。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201102,"trial_step":102},{"step":108,"speaker":"切尔西","content":"朋友？我可受不起你这样的朋友。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201103,"trial_step":103},{"step":109,"content":"耳中禁闭者的责备声此起彼伏，简直是一场噩梦。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201104,"trial_step":104},{"step":110,"content":"……噩梦？","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201105,"trial_step":105},{"step":111,"content":"你或许知道这是怎么回事了。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201106,"trial_step":106},{"step":112,"options":["卡米利安将你催眠了"],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201107,"trial_step":107,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"卡米利安将你催眠了","goto":108}]},{"step":113,"content":"“啪嗒。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1160202},{"step":114,"content":"你又听见了熟悉的金属碰撞声。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1160202},{"step":115,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"嗯，醒得比我预料的更晚一些。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1160202},{"step":116,"content":"卡米利安还坐在审查室里，把玩着手中的怀表。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1160202},{"step":117,"options":["你从什么时候开始催眠我的？","你为什么要给我看这些？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201112,"trial_step":112,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"你从什么时候开始催眠我的？","goto":113},{"text":"你为什么要给我看这些？","goto":114}]},{"step":118,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哼哼~从夜莺进来中断审查开始，都是假象。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1160202,"next":[115]},{"step":119,"content":"就为了逃避审查吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1160202,"next":[115]},{"step":120,"content":"如果你不想回答案件相关的事，可以选择保持沉默。但擅自对他人使用催眠术，是违背心理医生职业道德的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1160202},{"step":121,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哎呀呀，别这么生气。我只是想试试你对审查、对精神连接，究竟有多自信。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1160202},{"step":122,"content":"你做这些也没用，审问禁闭者的过去，补充梳理禁闭者的罪行，是我应尽的职责和义务。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1160202},{"step":123,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哈哈哈哈哈，如果你真的那么坚定，又怎么会被我催眠呢？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1160202},{"step":124,"content":"你……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1160202},{"step":125,"content":"你无法反驳，催眠后看见自己被禁闭者厌弃、质疑、疏离的痛苦，此时还令你心有余悸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1160202},{"step":126,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"其实除了窥探别人的痛苦，我们之间的“罪行”还有一个共同点——利用别人的信任。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1160202},{"step":127,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"你在审查中与禁闭者建立信任套取信息，而催眠也需要获得患者的信任。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1160202},{"step":128,"content":"我从没有相信过你说的任何一个字。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1160202},{"step":129,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"这不重要……绝对的怀疑，又未尝不是一种信任呢？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1160202},{"step":130,"content":"她似乎并不打算为自己的话做出解释，只是居高临下地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1160202},{"step":131,"content":"这份目无一切的傲慢，让你再一次体会到夜莺所说的“危险”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1160202},{"step":132,"content":"看来有必要采取强制措施了——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1160202},{"step":133,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201129,"trial_step":129,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":130}]},{"step":134,"content":"暗红色的光芒将卡米利安覆盖包裹，她没有抵抗，甚至没有低头看一眼自己身上的变化。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1160202},{"step":135,"content":"控制住你的异能后，我有很多方法能让你开口，你不害怕吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1160202},{"step":136,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"那局长就不害怕我吗？被催眠过一次的人，就会有第二次，第三次……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1160202},{"step":137,"content":"我不会再让你得逞了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1160202},{"step":138,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"话别说太早了，局长。催眠可是非常实用的心理治疗手段，特别是当您想要忘记或想要记起什么的时候……","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1160202},{"step":139,"speaker":"局长","content":"我不需要。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1160202},{"step":140,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"哼哼，这谁能知道呢？如果你真的忘记了什么，欢迎来找我咨询~","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1160201},{"step":141,"options":["呼叫夜莺，结束审查"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201137,"trial_step":137,"course":3,"drawing":1160201,"choices":[{"text":"呼叫夜莺，结束审查","goto":138}]},{"step":142,"content":"夜莺，将卡米利安单独关入禁闭室，没收她的怀表，警卫定时轮岗。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1160201},{"step":143,"content":"直到她愿意坦白罪行动机为止，不许任何人靠近！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1160201},{"step":144,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长好像不愿意再理我了……是恼羞成怒了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1160203},{"step":145,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"放轻松~我们是一样的，都曾身怀痛苦，也为人们带去痛苦。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1160201},{"step":146,"content":"她凑近身子伏在你耳边。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1160201},{"step":147,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"然而在这个混乱的时代，痛苦……不见得是一件坏事。","voice":["vo_trial_160201_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_chameleon_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1160201},{"step":148,"content":"直到卡米利安被警卫带走，你的不安都没有减退。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1160200},{"step":149,"content":"她在审查室中种种不坦诚的表现，真的只是为了逃避坦白真相吗？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1160200},{"step":150,"content":"“痛苦不是一件坏事”……也许，这是她今天说的唯一一句真话。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260201147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1160200}]}